1001
01:30:59,420 --> 01:31:02,420
How to add some wrinkles to the gloves?

1002
01:31:02,420 --> 01:31:13,420
If you want to add wrinkles to the gloves, you can make a double layer effect.

1003
01:31:13,420 --> 01:31:24,420
After you make a double layer effect for it, select this version and drag it to the outside.

1004
01:31:24,420 --> 01:31:31,420
Then adjust the speed, so that there is a difference between the inner layer and the outer layer of the version.

1005
01:31:31,420 --> 01:31:32,420
OK.

1006
01:31:32,420 --> 01:31:56,420
In this way, there will be some wrinkles on the outer layer of the version.

